"In another terminal run the second server listening on localhost using "
"another port, in this case port 11888."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Introspection-and-analysis/Discovery-Server/Discovery-Server.rst:352
msgid ""
"Now, run each node in a different terminal. Use ``ROS_DISCOVERY_SERVER`` "
"environment variable to decide which server they are connected to. Be aware "
"that the `ids must match <https://fast-dds.docs.eprosima.com/en/v2.1.0/"
"fastdds/env_vars/env_vars.html>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Introspection-and-analysis/Discovery-Server/Discovery-Server.rst:370
msgid "$ ros2 run demo_nodes_cpp talker --ros-args --remap __node:=talker_1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Introspection-and-analysis/Discovery-Server/Discovery-Server.rst:388
msgid ""
"$ ros2 run demo_nodes_cpp listener --ros-args --remap __node:=listener_1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Introspection-and-analysis/Discovery-Server/Discovery-Server.rst:406
msgid "$ ros2 run demo_nodes_cpp talker --ros-args --remap __node:=talker_2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Introspection-and-analysis/Discovery-Server/Discovery-Server.rst:414
msgid "$ export ROS_DISCOVERY_SERVER=\";127.0.0.1:11888\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Introspection-and-analysis/Discovery-Server/Discovery-Server.rst:420
msgid "$ set ROS_DISCOVERY_SERVER=\";127.0.0.1:11888\""
